9,Tarahumara of Geography Topics | Question AI,https://www.questionai.com/knowledge/k7YQAnpsR4-tarahumara,"Tarahumara , Middle American Indians of Barranca de Cobre (“Copper Canyon”), southwestern Chihuahua state, in northern Mexico . Their language, which belongs to the Sonoran division of the Uto-Aztecan family, is most closely related to those of the Yaqui and.","Tarahumara, Northern",Uto-Aztecan
